# R3 SFW H1 Phase A.2: the `studio-build-logic` module has a source
# path that includes `/studio/build/logic/` — the segment `build/`
# would match the `build/` ignore pattern above and silently exclude
# the plugin sources. Restore them explicitly.
!studio-build-logic/src/

